    "template": "Deep within the mountains lies the entrance to the cave. The walls are covered in [glowing_adjective] moss that glows in the dark. Every step creates a sound that bounces off the jagged ceilings. It is a place of ancient secrets and quiet beauty.\n\nWhen you whisper a secret, the cave answers with a [echo_sound]. The air feels like [tactile_feeling], swirling around your shoulders. You can see the light reflecting off the subterranean pools.\n\nNear the back of the cavern, a [ancient_creature] carved from crystal sits waiting. Its eyes seem to follow you as you move through the shadows. Below its feet, a [sparkling_item] rests on a stone pedestal. The silence here is deeper than anywhere else in the world.\n\nAs you prepare to leave, you leave behind a [wardrobe_item] as an offering. The cave rewards you with a vision of a [dream_destination]. You walk back into the sunlight feeling renewed and calm.",
